From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:12:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] AROS: expat's arc4random_buf() source file

The configuration header already selects arc4random_buf() as the entropy
source on AROS, but the source list still took the /dev/urandom file, so
writeRandomBytes_arc4random_buf() was missing when a program linked
libFGExpat.a.

Found by linking fgfs.
---
 3rdparty/expat/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/3rdparty/expat/CMakeLists.txt b/3rdparty/expat/CMakeLists.txt
index 024dd0c..ffeb478 100644
--- a/3rdparty/expat/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/3rdparty/expat/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@ target_sources(FGExpat PRIVATE
 
 if (WIN32)
     target_sources(FGExpat PRIVATE random_rand_s.c random_rand_s.h)
-elseif(APPLE)
+elseif(APPLE OR AROS)
     target_sources(FGExpat PRIVATE random_arc4random_buf.c random_arc4random_buf.h)
 elseif(HAVE_GETRANDOM)
     target_sources(FGExpat PRIVATE random_getrandom.c random_getrandom.h)
